   "I'm a mechanical design engineer from Karachi, Pakistan, with over 5 years of design experience. I've worked across consumer products, 3D-printed prototypes, mechanisms, structural analysis, and thermal systems. I graduated top of my class in Mechanical Engineering from DHA Suffa University in 2024. Through freelance and contract work, I've delivered over 190 projects for clients in 26 countries.",
